{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_0_level_main_00-02_beg",
  "groupId": "main_0",
  "stageId": "main_00-02",
  "title": "守卫",
  "storyCode": "0-2",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "29c8f31e6e1592d8eac7f83e1188e34d37d4061de9aa68055302358a2b617f53",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这终归还是，太超乎我的想象了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爆炸，骚乱，火光，巷战......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道整个切尔诺伯格，都陷入了这种混乱吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在切尔诺伯格军警的团结协作与迅速反应之下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......情况已经被控制，大部分区域的意外事件已经被镇压。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目前，切尔诺伯格军警已经包围了盘踞在瓦舒克大道上的暴徒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可见，这一次无谋的袭击，将很快结束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请各位不要惊慌，待在屋中，等待切尔诺伯格的又一场胜利......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乌萨斯的荣光保佑着陛下和他的人民！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可恶，他们，他们......那些武器和装备，究竟是哪里来的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要畏缩！就算穿上护甲，懦夫依旧是懦夫！不过是些缺乏训练的暴徒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，可是他们的数量......！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们已经干掉了我们数量三倍之多的敌人！再干掉三倍的敌人，战斗就结束了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少口出狂言了，切尔诺伯格的混蛋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者渣滓，也配和我们为敌？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "逮捕你们和你们肮脏的爹妈时就该把你们全部当场处死，而不是流放和苦役！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们这些家伙......！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......！他们在冲击防线，前卫没法再支撑多长时间了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了陛下！给我顶住！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，我要......坚持不住了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警队长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "退后的人，统统处死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军警",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "待在这里别动！我们还不能暴露！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乌萨斯的军警队伍......居然被整合运动压制住了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......电视上播放的内容，和现实完全不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "切尔诺伯格当局，到了这个时候，还在耍这种手段吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，对于我们来说，事情也同样在变糟。指望通过更加隐秘的手段离开，已经不现实了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟糕的路况和敌人的封锁......我们已经没办法再利用载具分别行动了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，救援小队只有在具备一定规模时，才能有效消灭盘踞在要道上的整合运动敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再切分小队，只会是自取灭亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些乌萨斯军警......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使他们的装备很精良，看起来也很有实力，但整合运动......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论是人数还是士气，都占压倒性的优势！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和我们对切尔诺伯格进行初步侦察时完全不同......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我们潜入时，切尔诺伯格军警与驻扎部队的数量、分布，以及状态，处在一个非常古怪的状态。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是在那个时候，我们没办法确定原因而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道整合运动，已经秘密地消灭了切尔诺伯格的大部分防卫力量吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有任何证据可以证明，整合运动的力量真的庞大到如此地步，还能够谋划这么大规模的战略......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，我怕是只能庆幸，被包围的是那些军警，而不是我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，我们也必须提防四周的情况，等到陷入危机，就已经晚了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士，快召集各小队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "侦查干员发现了整合运动，他们马上就要和我们的救援队伍接触了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——至少，我们现在的优势，也就只有谨小慎微这一点了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这，这里也有武装力量？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各小队，作战准备！不要给他们反击的机会！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
